sequence v0
# Default claim timing; a crash without a report retries after backoff.
# Static sequence: ablauf 0.3.0 does not support sequence playback.

participant a "Launcher A" tone=agent
participant github "GitHub"
participant b "Launcher B" tone=agent

a --> github : Post issue lease; reread and win (expires in 30 min)
a --> github : Push draft PR checkpoint
a --> github : Renew lease every 10 min
note over a: Machine stops
b --> github : Poll: lease expired, no report
note over github,b: Lost run counts as one failed attempt; retry after backoff from lease expiry
b --> github : Post own issue lease; reread and win
b --> github : Start on a new run branch; continue the earlier branch's open draft PR
b --> github : Mark PR ready; report handoff
github -.-> b : Handoff accepted; PR gets needs-review
